== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*Not to be confused with [[battletide]].
*''Tide of battle'' was originally a level 9 [[sorcerer]]  / [[wizard]] spell, but was removed from all spell lists prior to publication. Thus, this spell is only available through items, such as the (standard) ''tide of battle'' [[scroll]].
*The damage distribution of this spell is not uniform. Each creature in the area of effect has a 30% chance of receiving 30 damage, and a 1% chance for each damage amount in the 31-100 range. (The damage is a [[d100]] roll, with a minimum of 30.)

